    1	# Proposal C — Hecke / arithmetic fingerprint as primality oracle
    2	
    3	## Setup
    4	
    5	For n in [2, 10000] (containing 1229 primes, 8770 composites), compute fingerprints of varying depth combining:
    6	
    7	1. tau(n) - n^11 - 1 (mod 691) -- the Ramanujan congruence (zero on primes)
    8	2. tau(n) mod 5
    9	3. sigma_1(n) - 1 - n -- zero iff n is prime or 1
    10	4. n mod 30
    11	5. n^6 mod 7
